\def\@LN@column{1}
\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {2}{\ignorespaces The single-exponential lifetime law of the equivariant-Lyapunov preprint (arXiv:2605.03338), run \emph  {unchanged} on the trained models, is the overdamped face of the transverse-curvature price list. Measured/predicted lifetime ratio versus breaking magnitude, $14$ regimes, $5$ seeds: $\approx 1$ overdamped, reproducing its reported median $1.013$; a $2.2\times $ delay spike at the exceptional point; declining to $0.31\times $ deep underdamped --- containment exact below the crossover, failing above it in the calculable ballistic direction. \emph  {Evidence.}}}{6}{figure.2}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:lifetime_headtohead}{{2}{6}{The single-exponential lifetime law of the equivariant-Lyapunov preprint (arXiv:2605.03338), run \emph {unchanged} on the trained models, is the overdamped face of the transverse-curvature price list. Measured/predicted lifetime ratio versus breaking magnitude, $14$ regimes, $5$ seeds: $\approx 1$ overdamped, reproducing its reported median $1.013$; a $2.2\times $ delay spike at the exceptional point; declining to $0.31\times $ deep underdamped --- containment exact below the crossover, failing above it in the calculable ballistic direction. \emph {Evidence.}}{figure.2}{}}
